      "id": "claim_2f323c991bc64fd8b0ba226331231550",
      "statement": "The pre-push checklist runs in a fixed order — `list_migrations`, then `list_tables` for orientation — and confirms a specific migration by its objects named individually in `pg_proc` (functions) and `pg_policies` (policies) plus its columns by name.",
