    {
      "id": "claim_5e230193ae284dcd80b6772ca8b32a90",
      "statement": "Policy sets must never be compared: several migrations add policies to the same tables and Postgres OR-combines permissive policies, so a set comparison returns a superset and reads as a match no matter what the candidate migration is missing.",
